  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ebola is Real&#x201d;: Eradicating Ebola through Public theatre (Public Awareness)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the incidence of Ebola outbreak in Liberia and to promote the use of preventive methods in the control of Ebola in Bong County, CAFOD is supporting one of her partners Development and Education Network- Liberia (DEN-L) to implement a project that is focused on sensitization. The strategy employed is to conduct public awareness on Ebola through theatre. The public awareness will provide information on EVD through a forum, open engagement and discussion process that allows the awareness team to perform dramas on the modes of transmission and prevention of the disease.</narrative>
  </description>
